      "sha256": "0832bdbde308ad6310e009cfeb0ac6609685cfeebeac81214c23c000a4f042e9",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 2. VizCode workflow. Several students edit code in VS Code. Their editing data flows to a central data server, illustrated with a JSON example containing a value, an add operation, and a position. Connections between students and server are labeled Websocket and HTTP. A bidirectional Websocket connection links the server to an instructor dashboard, allowing the instructor to monitor the students in real time."
    }
